{"unit_id":"lileikeji__dsh-super-injector#card-zh","repo":"lileikeji/dsh-super-injector","commit":"04aa9b1b77cf92bcab56c6e05c3b54abe54cdad6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Super Injector 是面向 DSH Web 的插件管理扩展：它在 Host 侧注册工具，并在设置页提供插件列表和操作界面。用户可从本地目录注入或卸载插件包，查看注入状态，并进行热重载、路由清理和侧挂工具转正；还可生成 toolkit、守护循环、UI 面板或混合形态的插件骨架。适合在本地 DSH Web 中迭代和管理插件的开发者。运行需要本地 DSH Web 与插件目录；默认将注入清单写入用户目录，并在 Web profile 下创建插件链接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2446-2514","lib/index.js:2857-2895","lib/client/index.js:155-163"]}
{"unit_id":"lileikeji__dsh-super-injector#card-en","repo":"lileikeji/dsh-super-injector","commit":"04aa9b1b77cf92bcab56c6e05c3b54abe54cdad6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Super Injector manages local plugins in DSH Web. Host tools inject and uninstall packages, show status, reload code, and clean routes. A settings page lists plugins and supports local package actions. It also scaffolds plugin projects. It requires DSH Web and local plugin folders.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2446-2514","lib/index.js:2857-2895","lib/client/index.js:155-163"]}
