{"unit_id":"lileikeji__dsh-super-injector#feature-1","repo":"lileikeji/dsh-super-injector","commit":"04aa9b1b77cf92bcab56c6e05c3b54abe54cdad6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Super Injector 的功能「注入本地插件」：将本地插件包接入运行中的 DSH。调用 dev_inject_plugin 并传入含 package.json 和 lib/ 的目录，即可执行注入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2446-2482"]}
